Package: hid-apple-iso-layout
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Petrus Repo <petrus.repo@amd.com>
Priority: optional
Section: admin
Description: Use the ISO layout for Apple keyboards
 The hid_apple driver does not find the ISO layout of a Magic Keyboard
 on Bluetooth, so the § and < keys are swapped. This package sets
 iso_layout=1 for hid_apple.
